<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel stock jumps on stocks forecast.</title>
<headline>Portucel stock jumps on stocks forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Portuguese pulp producer Portucel Industrial hit a new record high of 1,275 escudos, up 6.69 percent on Monday's close, after the company forecast a sharp fall in NorScan pulp stocks in April, dealers said.</p>
<p>A company spokesman told Reuters that there were &quot;good prospects&quot; of stocks having fallen over 200,000 tonnes last month.</p>
</text>
